# Kenwood TS-990S PC CONTROL COMMAND REFERENCE GUIDE
# Printed revision/date: no revision printed; cover date "January/30/2019".
# Command: ID "Transceiver ID Number"
# Printed page 31 = PDF page 32. Charts used: Read, Answer. (No Set chart is printed.)
# Derivation date: 08/09/2026.
# NO code, no generator, no other file and no other document was consulted.
#
# COUNTED FRAME LENGTHS
#   Read   : 3 positions. Ruler 1..10; cells 'I' 'D' ';'. Terminator at printed position 3.
#   Answer : 6 positions. Ruler 1..10; cells 'I' 'D' P1 P1 P1 ';'. Terminator at printed
#            position 6. Every header is a NUMBER.
#
# POSITION MAP
#   Read    1 'I'   2 'D'   3 ';'
#   Answer  1 'I'   2 'D'   3-5 P1   6 ';'
#
# LEGEND, VERBATIM - the whole of it, exactly as printed:
#   "P1"
#   "  022"
#   There is NO model name printed against the number, unlike the 890S book which prints
